      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city hosts Park Afek, a large urban park that features walking trails, ponds, and the remnants of an ancient Ottoman railway station.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
